### Prueba 1: Generar Protocolo Pre-Quirúrgico (Patrón Builder)
POST http://localhost:3000/nursing-care/protocols/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "paciente-123",
  "admissionReason": "PRE_OP"
}

### Prueba 2: Registrar Signos Vitales en Base de Datos Real
POST http://localhost:3000/nursing-care/vital-signs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "paciente-123",
  "temperature": 38.5,
  "bloodPressure": "120/80",
  "heartRate": 85
}

### Prueba 3: Registrar Signos Vitales con FIEBRE ALTA (Escenario 2)
POST http://localhost:3000/nursing-care/vital-signs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "paciente-123",
  "temperature": 40.5,
  "bloodPressure": "130/85",
  "heartRate": 110
}
### Prueba 4: Administrar Medicación (HU 1.2) - En término
POST http://localhost:3000/nursing-care/medication/administer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "paciente-123",
  "nurseId": "enfermero-Torres",
  "medicationName": "Ibuprofeno",
  "dose": "400mg",
  "scheduledTime": "2026-10-15T14:00:00Z",
  "administeredTime": "2026-10-15T14:15:00Z"
}

### Prueba 5: Administrar Medicación (HU 1.2) - Fuera de término
POST http://localhost:3000/nursing-care/medication/administer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "paciente-123",
  "nurseId": "enfermero-Torres",
  "medicationName": "Ibuprofeno",
  "dose": "400mg",
  "scheduledTime": "2026-10-15T14:00:00Z",
  "administeredTime": "2026-10-15T14:45:00Z"
}

### Prueba 6: Generar Protocolo Pre-Quirúrgico (HU 2.1)
POST http://localhost:3000/nursing-care/protocols/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "paciente-789",
  "admissionReason": "Paciente preparado para CIRUGIA general"
}

### Prueba 7: Generar Protocolo Infección Respiratoria (HU 2.1)
POST http://localhost:3000/nursing-care/protocols/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "paciente-789",
  "admissionReason": "Ingresa por cuadro de NEUMONIA atípica"
}

### Prueba 8: Consultar Historial de Signos Vitales
GET http://localhost:3000/nursing-care/vital-signs/paciente-123